@startuml
title Features: Clients Configuration & Context Switch
skinparam maxMessageSize 150
autonumber

actor "Super User / Admin" as User
participant "Browser (Vue SPA)" as Browser
participant "Laravel (BFF)" as BFF
participant "ERP/CRM API" as ERP
participant "Redis Cache" as Cache

== Feature 3, 4, 5: ERP/CRM Client Integration ==

note over ERP: Feature 4: ERP/CRM Integration (Legacy Korian)

User -> Browser: Open Client/Sedi Configurations (Gestione Clienti)
Browser -> BFF: GET /admin/clients?sync=true
BFF -> ERP: GET /crm/clients & GET /crm/locations (Sedi)
ERP -> BFF: Legacy Korian CRM Data
BFF -> Cache: Sync & Store Client/Location Map in Redis
BFF -> Browser: Display Synced Clients & Facilities

User -> Browser: Update Facility Details (Feature 5)
Browser -> BFF: PUT /admin/locations/{id}
BFF -> ERP: PUT /crm/locations/{id}
ERP -> BFF: Update Confirmed
BFF -> Browser: Changes Saved

== Feature 7, 20: Context Switching ==

note over User, ERP: Feature 7: Change Facility (Super User)\nFeature 20: Search by Client (Admin)

User -> Browser: Select Target Client or Facility (Cambio sede)
Browser -> BFF: POST /api/context/switch
BFF -> ERP: Validate User Authorization for Target Context
ERP -> BFF: Allowed
BFF -> Browser: 200 OK (Store Context ID in App State/Session)

User -> Browser: Fetch Invoices for Target Context
Browser -> BFF: GET /api/invoices
note over BFF: BFF reads current Context ID\nfrom Session rather than Entra ID
BFF -> ERP: GET /invoices?client_id={ContextID}
ERP -> BFF: Invoices List
BFF -> Browser: Display Invoices for Selected Context

@enduml
